  "description": "We are delighted to present a selection of beautifully refurbished two-bedroom apartments within one of Dundrum's most sought-after residential developments.\n\nFinished to a high standard throughout, these apartments offer modern, comfortable living in a prime South Dublin location. Recent upgrades include energy-efficient heating systems and stylish furniture packages, creating contemporary and welcoming homes.\n\nAccommodation typically comprises an entrance hallway with storage, a bright and spacious open-plan living and dining area, a fully fitted kitchen with integrated appliances, two generous double bedrooms with fitted wardrobes, modern bathrooms and a private balcony.\n\nResidents enjoy access to an excellent range of on-site amenities including a 24-hour concierge service, resident gym, secure underground parking and visitor parking.\n\nProfessionally managed and maintained, the development offers a high-quality rental experience with dedicated property management and responsive maintenance support.\n\nIdeally located just minutes from Dundrum Town Centre and the LUAS Green Line, the development is within easy reach of an excellent selection of shops, cafés, restaurants and leisure facilities. The M50 motorway is also nearby, providing convenient access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas.\n\nA number of similar apartments are available now, with additional units becoming available throughout July and August. Interested applicants are encouraged to register their interest to be notified of upcoming availability.",
